  "description": "Three years into their marriage, the once-passionate love between Su-an and Seonwoo was slowly drying up.\nBack when they were newlyweds, they couldn’t keep their hands off each other—making love in the bedroom, the living room, and even the bathroom the moment their eyes met. Now, Su-an can't even remember the last time they had sex.\n\nHaving dreamed of having children and building a warm, happy family, Su-an is already thirty-seven—an age where even conceiving tomorrow would be considered a high-risk pregnancy. Before it’s too late, he needs to rekindle his relationship with his husband and have a baby. With that, Su-an’s desperate seduction(!) of Seonwoo begins...! *(Source: MrBlue, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000082250)",
